#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-landmark.rst:16
#: f2227fea2a6640cf86fa7de0221346a2
msgid ""
"The `Landmark Precision Landing System "
"<https://landmarklanding.com/products/landmark-precision-landing-system>`__ "
"uses a camera module and fiducial landing target to provide centimeter-level"
" accuracy for landing and hovering over a target."
msgstr ""
"`Landmark精准降落系统 <https://landmarklanding.com/products/landmark-precision-"
"landing-system>`__ 使用摄像头模块和基准降落目标，在降落和悬停于目标上方时实现厘米级精度。"

